  dct:description "80 points have been determined for the price element. In doing so, the amount of the price without value-added tax will be imposed on the offer, whereby the most points will be awarded to the offer that has the type of most successful press contracts for the performance of thermo technical installations, electrical installation, hydro technical installations of high-rise buildings with over 10,000 m2"@en .

