  dct:description "The maximum number of the most successfully executed contracts of the type of performance of thermotechnical installations, electrical engineering installation, and hydrotechnical installations is 10 contracts on high-rise buildings with over 10,000 m2, whereby the maximum number of points will be awarded to the Economic Operator who offers the most contracts."@en .

